{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0125","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000101:text","row":22865,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"というわけで、部活中だったりする。","en":"And so, we were in the middle of club activities.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00001","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00001","en":"And with all that, here I am in the midst of club activities.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:0000013b:text","row":22866,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"この部品はどうするのだろう？","en":"What was I supposed to do with this part?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00002","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00002","en":"Where should I put this part now?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:0000016f:text","row":22867,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"ここか？","en":"Here?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00003","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00003","en":"Here?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:0000018f:text","row":22868,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"それともここか？","en":"Or here?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00004","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00004","en":"Or perhaps here?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000001bf:text","row":22869,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00005","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00005","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000001df:text","row":22870,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"ここにしておくか。それっぽい感じするし。","en":"Guess I’ll put it here. Looks about right.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00006","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00006","en":"How about I set it down here. It sort of feels kinda right.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000244:text","row":22871,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「わかりますかー？」","en":"“Can you make sense of it?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00007","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00007","en":"Misato: \"Do you get how to do iiit?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000278:text","row":22872,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「まー、なんとか」","en":"“More or less.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00008","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00008","en":"Taichi: \"Yeeeah, sorta.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000002a2:text","row":22873,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"下では先輩が脚立を支えてくれている。","en":"Misato was holding the stepladder steady below me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00009","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00009","en":"Below me, Senpai is holding the stepladder firm.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000303:text","row":22874,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「男の子がいると頼もしいですねー」","en":"“Having a boy here makes such a difference.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00010","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00010","en":"Misato: \"It is so reliable to have a boy heeere!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000345:text","row":22875,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうでしょうとも」","en":"“Indeed it does.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00011","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00011","en":"Taichi: \"Indeed, my lord!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000379:text","row":22876,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「ご用命の際はいつでもこの私メを……」","en":"“Whenever you have need of me, your humble servant remains at your disposal...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00012","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00012","en":"Taichi: \"Any moment is auspicious to order your worthless servant...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000003b7:text","row":22877,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"つうか。","en":"Wait.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00013","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00013","en":"Hold on,","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000003d7:text","row":22878,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"この人、弟いるじゃないか。","en":"She had a younger brother.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00014","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00014","en":"doesn't this person here have a younger brother?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000411:text","row":22879,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「……あの、友貴と喧嘩してますよね？」","en":"“...You and Tomoki are fighting, aren’t you?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00015","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00015","en":"Taichi: \"...uhm, are you fighting with Tomoki?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000461:text","row":22880,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩の顔が、さっと曇る。","en":"A shadow passed over Misato’s face.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00016","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00016","en":"Senpai's face instantly clouds.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000004b6:text","row":22881,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「あー、まあ……」","en":"“Ah, well...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00017","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00017","en":"Misato: \"Ahhh, well...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000505:text","row":22882,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「ちょっと冷戦に」","en":"“We’re in a bit of a cold war.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00018","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00018","en":"Misato: \"It is sort of a cold war.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000537:text","row":22883,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「友貴もケンカなんてするんだなぁ」","en":"“So even Tomoki gets into fights.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00019","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00019","en":"Taichi: \"Tomoki seems to be in a bit of a fight with you too, ya know.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000596:text","row":22884,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00020","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00020","en":"Misato: \"Eh?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000005be:text","row":22885,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「あいつ、本気で怒ることなんて滅多にないから」","en":"“He almost never gets seriously angry.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00021","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00021","en":"Taichi: \"It's just, it's rare that guy gets seriously angry.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000604:text","row":22886,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩はその言葉に、ショックを受けたようだった。","en":"Misato looked shocked by that.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00022","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00022","en":"Senpai seemed to be shocked at those words.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:0000066f:text","row":22887,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「……当然、なのかもしれないですね」","en":"“...Perhaps it was only natural.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00023","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00023","en":"Misato: \"...it may just be obvious, of course.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000006b3:text","row":22888,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい？」","en":"“What?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00024","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Huh?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000006fa:text","row":22889,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「人生は難しいですこんちくしょうという感じです」","en":"“Life is hard, goddammit—that’s about the shape of it.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00025","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00025","en":"Misato: \"It is that, 'life is hard, darn it all' feeling.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000742:text","row":22890,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"わけがわからない。","en":"I had no idea what she meant.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00026","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00026","en":"I'm not getting this.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000812:text","row":22891,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"『……裏切られるぞ』","en":"‘...You’ll be betrayed.’","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00027","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00027","en":"Tomoki: 『...you'll be betrayed.』","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:0000090e:text","row":22892,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「あの、裏切りとか、なんです？」","en":"“Um, what’s this about betrayal?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00028","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00028","en":"Taichi: \"Ah, is it this thing about 'betrayal'?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000946:text","row":22893,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"眉根が寄った。","en":"Her brows drew together.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00029","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00029","en":"The gap between her eyebrows grew tighter.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000991:text","row":22894,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「友貴が、そう言ってたんですか？」","en":"“Did Tomoki say that?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00030","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00030","en":"Misato: \"Was it Tomoki who said that?","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:000009d3:text","row":22895,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「はあ」","en":"“Uh, yeah.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00031","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Yeah.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000a18:text","row":22896,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00032","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00032","en":"Misato: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000a40:text","row":22897,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩？」","en":"“Misato?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00033","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00033","en":"Taichi: \"Senpai?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000a87:text","row":22898,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「……うーんうーん」","en":"“Mmm... mmm...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00034","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00034","en":"Misato: \"...nnngh... nnno...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000ab3:text","row":22899,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩は泣きそうな顔で、うーんうーん唸りだした。","en":"Misato began to groan, looking close to tears.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00035","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00035","en":"Senpai growled this no-like 'ngggh' with a tearful face.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000b01:text","row":22900,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「アノウ？」","en":"“Um...?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00036","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00036","en":"Taichi: \"H-e-l-l-o?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000b4a:text","row":22901,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんといいますかーもー！」","en":"“Oh, what am I supposed to say?!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00037","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00037","en":"Misato: \"What do you think that is even called, really!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000cfb:text","row":22902,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"がくがくと脚立を揺する。","en":"She rattled the stepladder.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00038","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00038","en":"She rocks the stepladder, clattering.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000ddf:text","row":22903,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「わわわっ！？」","en":"“W-whoa?!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00039","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00039","en":"Taichi: \"WahWahWah?!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000ed8:text","row":22904,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「ままならねーですーっ！！」","en":"“Nothing ever goes my waaay!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00040","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00040","en":"Misato: \"You cannot do that!!!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000f14:text","row":22905,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「落ちそーですっ！！」","en":"“I’m about to faaall!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00041","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00041","en":"Taichi: \"I'm gonna faaall!!!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0125:00000f42:text","row":22906,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"散々な部活だった。","en":"Club was a disaster.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00042","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0022b:00042","en":"These were miserable club activities.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]}]}
